  "id": "915de8ec-f50b-52ff-8287-06f7ac2af53c",
  "slug": "grandmas-sloppy-joes",
  "name": "Grandma\u2019s Sloppy Joes",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "My grandma gave me this recipe last year. My co-workers are always asking me to make it for them. The ground cloves add that special flavor",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large skillet over medium heat, combine the ground beef, onion, and green pepper. Cook until beef is browned, and drain off excess grease."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Stir in the brown sugar, vinegar, ketchup and mustard, and season with cloves and salt. Simmer for 30 minutes on low. Serve on hamburger buns."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 45,
